{"seq":3,"slug":"overtraining-syndrome-and-prevention","title":"过度训练综合征与预防","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery/overtraining-syndrome-and-prevention","wordCount":2531,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"过度训练综合征与预防\">过度训练综合征与预防</h1><p>过度训练综合征（Overtraining Syndrome, OTS）是训练负荷长期超过身体恢复能力时出现的病理状态，表现为持续的运动能力下降、神经内分泌失调和心理异常。与短期功能性过度延伸不同，OTS 可能需要数月甚至数年才能完全恢复，严重影响运动员职业生涯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>连续谱</strong>：从功能性过度延伸（FOR，计划内、数周恢复）到非功能性过度延伸（NFOR）再到过度训练综合征（OTS，数月至数年恢复）逐步发展。</li>\n<li><strong>排除性诊断</strong>：OTS 必须首先排除感染、铁缺乏、能量可用性不足、甲状腺与心理疾病等可致表现下降的其他原因。</li>\n<li><strong>病理生理核心</strong>：HPA 轴失调（交感型/副交感型两种亚型）、睾酮等合成激素下降、慢性低度炎症与免疫功能抑制、能量代谢紊乱共同构成机制。</li>\n<li><strong>多维度症状</strong>：表现为运动成绩持续下降、心血管/代谢/免疫/骨骼肌/神经/心理等多系统异常，并有可识别的早期预警信号。</li>\n<li><strong>预防优先</strong>：通过训练负荷管理（渐进性与变异性）、多维监控、充足能量可用性与系统化恢复降低风险。</li>\n<li><strong>治疗</strong>：核心是充分休息与纠正能量赤字，恢复重训需极缓慢递增并密切监控。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"过度训练的连续谱\">过度训练的连续谱</h2><h3 id=\"从功能性过度延伸到过度训练\">从功能性过度延伸到过度训练</h3><p>过度训练不是突然发生的，而是沿着一个连续谱逐步发展：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[正常训练&lt;br/&gt;适应良好] --&gt; B[功能性过度延伸&lt;br/&gt;FOR]&#10;    B --&gt; C[非功能性过度延伸&lt;br/&gt;NFOR]&#10;    C --&gt; D[过度训练综合征&lt;br/&gt;OTS]&#10;    B --&gt;|减量2周恢复| A&#10;    C --&gt;|数周至数月恢复| A&#10;    D --&gt;|数月至数年恢复| A&#10;    A ---|恢复时间递增| D\">flowchart LR\n    A[正常训练&lt;br/&gt;适应良好] --&gt; B[功能性过度延伸&lt;br/&gt;FOR]\n    B --&gt; C[非功能性过度延伸&lt;br/&gt;NFOR]\n    C --&gt; D[过度训练综合征&lt;br/&gt;OTS]\n    B --&gt;|减量2周恢复| A\n    C --&gt;|数周至数月恢复| A\n    D --&gt;|数月至数年恢复| A\n    A ---|恢复时间递增| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>英文术语</th>\n<th>表现下降持续时间</th>\n<th>恢复所需时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>功能性过度延伸（FOR）</td>\n<td>Functional Overreaching</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 1\\sim2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 1\\sim2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非功能性过度延伸（NFOR）</td>\n<td>Non-Functional Overreaching</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 2\\sim8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 周</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mtext>数周至数月</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 数周至数月</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数周至数月</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度训练综合征（OTS）</td>\n<td>Overtraining Syndrome</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 月</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mtext>数月至数年</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 数月至数年</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数月至数年</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键区别</strong>：FOR 是计划内的（短期超负荷后减量以获得超补偿），而 NFOR 和 OTS 是非计划的病理状态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"诊断的排除法则\">诊断的排除法则</h3><p>OTS 是一个<strong>排除性诊断</strong>——必须首先排除其他可能导致表现下降的原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>感染/疾病（如病毒感染后疲劳）</li>\n<li>铁缺乏/贫血</li>\n<li>能量可用性不足（REDs/RED-S）</li>\n<li>甲状腺功能异常</li>\n<li>心理疾病（抑郁症、焦虑症）</li>\n<li>睡眠障碍</li>\n<li>药物副作用</li>\n<li>训练量或强度不足（非超负荷）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ots-的病理生理机制\">OTS 的病理生理机制</h2><h3 id=\"hpa-轴失调\">HPA 轴失调</h3><p>下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺（HPA）轴是应对应激的核心内分泌轴。长期过度训练导致 HPA 轴功能紊乱：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[持续高训练负荷&lt;br/&gt;+ 恢复不足] --&gt; B[慢性应激状态]&#10;    B --&gt; C[下丘脑CRH持续高分泌]&#10;    C --&gt; D[垂体ACTH反应&lt;br/&gt;初期增强 → 后期钝化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[肾上腺皮质反应改变]&#10;    E --&gt; F[交感型OTS&lt;br/&gt;皮质醇基线升高&lt;br/&gt;对应激反应过度]&#10;    E --&gt; G[副交感型OTS&lt;br/&gt;皮质醇基线降低&lt;br/&gt;对应激反应不足]&#10;    F --&gt; H[分解代谢增强&lt;br/&gt;免疫抑制&lt;br/&gt;胰岛素抵抗]&#10;    G --&gt; I[疲劳/冷漠&lt;br/&gt;低血压&lt;br/&gt;低血糖]\">flowchart TD\n    A[持续高训练负荷&lt;br/&gt;+ 恢复不足] --&gt; B[慢性应激状态]\n    B --&gt; C[下丘脑CRH持续高分泌]\n    C --&gt; D[垂体ACTH反应&lt;br/&gt;初期增强 → 后期钝化]\n    D --&gt; E[肾上腺皮质反应改变]\n    E --&gt; F[交感型OTS&lt;br/&gt;皮质醇基线升高&lt;br/&gt;对应激反应过度]\n    E --&gt; G[副交感型OTS&lt;br/&gt;皮质醇基线降低&lt;br/&gt;对应激反应不足]\n    F --&gt; H[分解代谢增强&lt;br/&gt;免疫抑制&lt;br/&gt;胰岛素抵抗]\n    G --&gt; I[疲劳/冷漠&lt;br/&gt;低血压&lt;br/&gt;低血糖]</pre><p><strong>两种亚型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>交感型（Sympathetic OTS）</th>\n<th>副交感型（Parasympathetic OTS）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常见于</td>\n<td>短跑/力量运动员</td>\n<td>耐力运动员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静息心率</td>\n<td>升高</td>\n<td>可能降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动中最大心率</td>\n<td>正常或升高</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础代谢率</td>\n<td>升高</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>睡眠</td>\n<td>失眠、入睡困难</td>\n<td>嗜睡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情绪</td>\n<td>易激惹、焦躁</td>\n<td>冷漠、抑郁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>皮质醇</td>\n<td>基线偏高</td>\n<td>基线偏低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动反应</td>\n<td>过度反应</td>\n<td>反应不足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"神经内分泌改变\">神经内分泌改变</h3><p><strong>睾酮与合成代谢激素</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>游离睾酮持续下降</li>\n<li>SHBG（性激素结合球蛋白）升高 → 有效睾酮进一步减少</li>\n<li>T/C 比值下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>GH 和 IGF-1 分泌对运动刺激的反应钝化</li>\n<li>黄体生成素（LH）脉冲节律紊乱</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>细胞因子与慢性炎症</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IL-6 基线升高（但运动诱导的 IL-6 峰值可能降低）</li>\n<li>慢性低度炎症状态</li>\n<li>C-反应蛋白（CRP）轻度升高</li>\n<li>TNF-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 水平偏高</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"免疫功能抑制\">免疫功能抑制</h3><p>&quot;J 形曲线&quot;模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>感染风险</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>运动量</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{感染风险} = f(\\text{运动量})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">感染风险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运动量</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>适度运动：免疫功能最优，感染风险最低</li>\n<li>极高训练量：免疫功能下降，上呼吸道感染（URTI）风险显著升高</li>\n</ul>\n<p>OTS 时的免疫变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>淋巴细胞增殖反应下降</li>\n<li>NK 细胞活性降低</li>\n<li>分泌型 IgA（sIgA）浓度下降</li>\n<li>中性粒细胞吞噬功能减弱</li>\n<li>&quot;开窗期&quot;（Open Window）：高强度训练后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>72</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sim72h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 内免疫力暂时下降</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"能量代谢与代谢失调\">能量代谢与代谢失调</h3><p>长期能量负平衡加剧 OTS 发展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>糖原储备慢性不足 → 运动中过度依赖蛋白质供能</li>\n<li>相对能量缺乏综合征（REDs）与 OTS 密切重叠</li>\n<li>脂肪氧化能力可能受损（线粒体功能障碍）</li>\n<li>胰岛素敏感性改变</li>\n<li>氨基酸代谢紊乱（色氨酸/支链氨基酸比值升高 → 中枢5-HT 增加 → 中枢疲劳）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ots-的症状与识别\">OTS 的症状与识别</h2><h3 id=\"多维度症状\">多维度症状</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>具体症状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>运动表现</strong></td>\n<td>成绩持续下降（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 月）、训练耐受力下降、恢复延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>心血管</strong></td>\n<td>静息心率改变、最大心率下降、HRV 改变、体位性低血压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>代谢</strong></td>\n<td>体重波动、食欲改变、月经紊乱（女性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>免疫</strong></td>\n<td>反复感染、伤口愈合延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>骨骼肌</strong></td>\n<td>持续肌肉酸痛、力量下降、协调性变差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>神经系统</strong></td>\n<td>注意力下降、反应迟钝、精细动作退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>心理</strong></td>\n<td>情绪低落、动机丧失、易怒、睡眠障碍、对训练厌恶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>消化</strong></td>\n<td>消化功能紊乱、腹胀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"早期预警信号\">早期预警信号</h3><p>在发展为完全 OTS 之前通常有可识别的预警：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相同训练负荷下 RPE 升高</li>\n<li>晨起 HRV 持续下降（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 天）</li>\n<li>静息心率持续升高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> bpm</li>\n<li>训练表现不再对减量作出正面反应</li>\n<li>睡眠质量主观下降</li>\n<li>情绪异常（特别是训练动机丧失）</li>\n<li>反复轻微感染（如口腔溃疡、咽痛）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"预防策略\">预防策略</h2><h3 id=\"训练负荷管理\">训练负荷管理</h3><p><strong>渐进性原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每周训练负荷增加不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>（&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span> 法则&quot;）</li>\n<li>每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sim4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周安排一个减量周（负荷降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%\\sim60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>ACWR（急性:慢性负荷比）维持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8\\sim1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>训练变异性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免单调性（Monotony Index = 周平均负荷 / 标准差）</li>\n<li>高单调 + 高负荷 = 高应变（Strain）= 高风险</li>\n<li>周内负荷变化确保有高-低-中的波动</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"监控系统\">监控系统</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[多维度监控] --&gt; B[主观指标]&#10;    A --&gt; C[客观生理指标]&#10;    A --&gt; D[表现指标]&#10;    B --&gt; E[POMS情绪量表&lt;br/&gt;RESTQ恢复-应激问卷&lt;br/&gt;晨起Wellness评分]&#10;    C --&gt; F[晨起HRV rMSSD&lt;br/&gt;静息心率趋势&lt;br/&gt;血液CK/铁蛋白]&#10;    D --&gt; G[CMJ/SJ高度&lt;br/&gt;训练功率趋势&lt;br/&gt;子最大运动HR/乳酸]&#10;    E --&gt; H{阈值警报}&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|触发| I[调整训练/增加恢复]\">flowchart TD\n    A[多维度监控] --&gt; B[主观指标]\n    A --&gt; C[客观生理指标]\n    A --&gt; D[表现指标]\n    B --&gt; E[POMS情绪量表&lt;br/&gt;RESTQ恢复-应激问卷&lt;br/&gt;晨起Wellness评分]\n    C --&gt; F[晨起HRV rMSSD&lt;br/&gt;静息心率趋势&lt;br/&gt;血液CK/铁蛋白]\n    D --&gt; G[CMJ/SJ高度&lt;br/&gt;训练功率趋势&lt;br/&gt;子最大运动HR/乳酸]\n    E --&gt; H{阈值警报}\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|触发| I[调整训练/增加恢复]</pre><h3 id=\"营养与能量可用性\">营养与能量可用性</h3><p>预防 OTS 的营养核心原则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>能量可用性</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>能量摄入</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>运动能耗</mtext></mrow><mtext>去脂体重</mtext></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>45</mn><mtext> kcal/kg FFM/d</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{能量可用性} = \\frac{\\text{能量摄入} - \\text{运动能耗}}{\\text{去脂体重}} \\geq 45 \\text{ kcal/kg FFM/d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">能量可用性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">去脂体重</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">能量摄入</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运动能耗</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kcal/kg FFM/d</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li>碳水匹配训练负荷：低日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sim5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> g/kg，高日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\sim10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> g/kg</li>\n<li>蛋白质充足：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.6\\sim2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span> g/kg/d</li>\n<li>避免长期热量赤字 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> kcal/d（特别是高训练量期）</li>\n<li>微量营养素关注：铁、维生素D、锌、镁</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"恢复策略的系统化\">恢复策略的系统化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恢复层面</th>\n<th>具体措施</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>睡眠</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\sim10h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>/晚，规律作息</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养</td>\n<td>能量充足、时机优化</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心理恢复</td>\n<td>正念/冥想、社交、爱好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练结构</td>\n<td>减量周、变异性、轻松日</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理手段</td>\n<td>冷热交替、按摩、压缩</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境</td>\n<td>减少生活应激源</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"心理健康与教练沟通\">心理健康与教练沟通</h3><ul>\n<li>培养&quot;聪明训练&quot;而非&quot;更多训练&quot;的文化</li>\n<li>运动员应被允许在感到过度疲劳时减少训练</li>\n<li>主观疲劳感不应被忽视或贬低</li>\n<li>建立开放的教练-运动员沟通渠道</li>\n<li>将恢复日视为训练的组成部分而非&quot;偷懒&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ots-的治疗\">OTS 的治疗</h2><h3 id=\"治疗原则\">治疗原则</h3><p>一旦诊断为 OTS，核心治疗是<strong>充分休息</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全停训或仅保留极低强度活动（步行、轻度游泳）</li>\n<li>持续时间：至少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\sim12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 周，可能更长</li>\n<li>解决能量赤字（增加热量摄入）</li>\n<li>睡眠优化（必要时使用认知行为疗法）</li>\n<li>心理支持（OTS 常伴随抑郁样症状）</li>\n<li>排除并治疗合并疾病</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"恢复重训的策略\">恢复重训的策略</h3><ul>\n<li>仅在所有症状完全消失后开始恢复训练</li>\n<li>从极低强度、极低容量开始（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span> 原训练量）</li>\n<li>每周增加不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%\\sim10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>密切监控主观和客观恢复指标</li>\n<li>若症状复发，立即回退一步</li>\n<li>完全恢复至原训练水平可能需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sim12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个月</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"特殊群体的额外风险\">特殊群体的额外风险</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>青少年运动员</strong>：发育期恢复需求更高，过度训练可影响生长</li>\n<li><strong>女性运动员</strong>：月经紊乱是早期预警（功能性下丘脑性闭经）</li>\n<li><strong>老年运动员</strong>：恢复能力降低，需更保守的负荷递增</li>\n<li><strong>双项训练/多项运动员</strong>：总负荷易被低估</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>过度训练综合征是训练负荷长期超过恢复能力所导致的病理状态，沿功能性过度延伸到非功能性过度延伸再到 OTS 的连续谱发展，恢复时间随之显著延长。由于 OTS 是排除性诊断，必须先排除感染、铁缺乏、能量可用性不足等可致表现下降的其他原因。其病理生理核心是 HPA 轴失调（分交感型与副交感型）、合成激素下降、慢性炎症与免疫抑制及能量代谢紊乱，症状覆盖运动表现、心血管、代谢、免疫、骨骼肌、神经与心理多系统，并常伴可识别的早期预警信号。因此预防优于治疗：通过渐进性、具变异性的负荷管理，多维监控，充足的能量可用性与系统化恢复来控制风险；一旦诊断成立，治疗核心是充分休息与纠正能量赤字，恢复重训需极其缓慢并持续监控以防复发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>Meeusen R, et al. Prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of the overtraining syndrome: joint consensus statement of the European College of Sport Science and the American College of Sports Medicine. Med Sci Sports Exerc, 2013; 45(1):186-205.</li>\n<li>Kreher JB, Schwartz JB. Overtraining syndrome: a practical guide. Sports Health, 2012; 4(2):128-138.</li>\n<li>Cadegiani FA, Kater CE. Hormonal aspects of overtraining syndrome: a systematic review. BMC Sports Sci Med Rehabil, 2017; 9:14.</li>\n<li>Halson SL, Jeukendrup AE. Does overtraining exist? An analysis of overreaching and overtraining research. Sports Med, 2004; 34(14):967-981.</li>\n<li>Soligard T, et al. How much is too much? (Part 1) International Olympic Committee consensus statement on load in sport and risk of injury. Br J Sports Med, 2016; 50(17):1030-1041.</li>\n<li>Powers SK, Howley ET. Exercise Physiology: Theory and Application to Fitness and Performance. 11th ed. McGraw-Hill, 2023.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过度训练综合征与预防","id":"过度训练综合征与预防"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"过度训练的连续谱","id":"过度训练的连续谱"},{"level":3,"text":"从功能性过度延伸到过度训练","id":"从功能性过度延伸到过度训练"},{"level":3,"text":"诊断的排除法则","id":"诊断的排除法则"},{"level":2,"text":"OTS 的病理生理机制","id":"ots-的病理生理机制"},{"level":3,"text":"HPA 轴失调","id":"hpa-轴失调"},{"level":3,"text":"神经内分泌改变","id":"神经内分泌改变"},{"level":3,"text":"免疫功能抑制","id":"免疫功能抑制"},{"level":3,"text":"能量代谢与代谢失调","id":"能量代谢与代谢失调"},{"level":2,"text":"OTS 的症状与识别","id":"ots-的症状与识别"},{"level":3,"text":"多维度症状","id":"多维度症状"},{"level":3,"text":"早期预警信号","id":"早期预警信号"},{"level":2,"text":"预防策略","id":"预防策略"},{"level":3,"text":"训练负荷管理","id":"训练负荷管理"},{"level":3,"text":"监控系统","id":"监控系统"},{"level":3,"text":"营养与能量可用性","id":"营养与能量可用性"},{"level":3,"text":"恢复策略的系统化","id":"恢复策略的系统化"},{"level":3,"text":"心理健康与教练沟通","id":"心理健康与教练沟通"},{"level":2,"text":"OTS 的治疗","id":"ots-的治疗"},{"level":3,"text":"治疗原则","id":"治疗原则"},{"level":3,"text":"恢复重训的策略","id":"恢复重训的策略"},{"level":3,"text":"特殊群体的额外风险","id":"特殊群体的额外风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"恢复生理学与超补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/exercise-physiology/training-principles-and-recovery/recovery-physiology-and-supercompensation"},"next":null}